Built with Qwen
---------------

The models trained here start from Qwen2.5-VL checkpoints. The caption arms are
trained on caption stores generated by Qwen2.5-VL-3B-Instruct.
Qwen2.5-VL-72B-Instruct is used only for the caption-stress checks, which
caption the grounding-instrument images and the constructed scenes; no arm is
trained on its captions. The Qwen licence agreements require that any model
created, trained, fine-tuned or improved using Qwen outputs prominently display
"Built with Qwen" or "Improved using Qwen". This notice discharges that
requirement.


