Dataset terms
-------------

This repository contains no corpus data. The dataset repository that
scripts/fetch_data.py downloads carries filtered Geometry3K and ViRL39K rows,
the Geometry3K images and the ViRL39K images of the audit sample, under these
terms:

  Geometry3K   MIT. Pinned upstream revision
               fd21e533e1e50d0662a2bf7b223e60511bd5f8b7.
  ViRL39K      MIT. Pinned upstream revision
               812ec617dea4bc8a4e751663b88e4ebb7de4d00e.
               ViRL39K collects items from several public sources and each
               row records its source in metadata.source. MMK12
               (Apache-2.0) is the source of the rows marked MMK12 and
               MMK12Converted.

  The held-out evaluation benchmarks (MMStar, MMMU, MathVista, MathVerse, BLINK,
  MMVP, HallusionBench) are used through VLMEvalKit under their own upstream
  terms. Check those terms before redistributing any benchmark material.


Third-party source
------------------

  EasyR1       https://github.com/hiyouga/EasyR1
               Apache-2.0, pinned at dd71bbd252694f5f850213eec15795b6b88d9fea.
               The modifications used here are distributed as unified diffs
               under patches/easyr1/; no complete EasyR1 file is redistributed.
  verl         https://github.com/volcengine/verl
               Apache-2.0, upstream revision 6a4a078. EasyR1 is built on verl
               and carries it as its verl/ package. The diffs under
               patches/easyr1/ modify files in that package (verl/trainer,
               verl/utils and verl/workers), so the verl used here is
               modified; the diffs record every change.
  VLMEvalKit   https://github.com/open-compass/VLMEvalKit
               Apache-2.0, pinned at 6a02ab9, used unmodified and not
               redistributed.


Not contained in this repository
--------------------------------

No model weights, no trained checkpoints, no corpora and no run outputs are
distributed here. The download helper fetches the released data separately.
